# A movie's sound ends with the movie (cavekit-flash.md R9, T-579): the tone movie's stream on the sound server closes
# when the card navigates away, when the page is reloaded (the old stream gone, the new movie's own open), and when the
# card is closed, and plugin-container, which outlives its last movie by 30 s, holds none open. The bound is counted
# from the end of the gesture's own wait (about:blank's load, well under a second; the reload and the close: at once).
id: flash-sound-close
section: Media and sound
item: A Flash movie's sound stream closes within 2 s of navigating away, of a reload (the new movie's own stream then opens) and of closing the card, and plugin-container holds none open after
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-tone.html
kit: cavekit-flash.md R9
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
expect audio audible 20
launch about:blank
expect audio closed 2
launch http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-tone.html
wait rect 'sel:embed' 30
expect audio audible 20
audio-mark
chrome reload
expect audio-renewed 2
expect audio audible 20
card-close
expect audio closed 2
expect sound silent 4
